{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:screenlex-watch-and-learn","title":"ScreenLex：把本地电影字幕变成英语词库","date":"2026-08-17","updated":"2026-08-17","summary":"本地影视英语学习工具：扫描本机 SRT/ASS 字幕，离线整理成按考试分级的高级英语词库，配套逐句学习播放器与主动回忆复习。支持 macOS（Apple Silicon）与 Windows（x64 arm）。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-工具","name":"工具","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-开发","name":"开发","color":"default"}],"image":"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/screenlex-watch-and-learn/image-01-66cd719d7b.png","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"screenlex-watch-and-learn","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"ScreenLex：把本地电影字幕变成英语词库","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<h2>ScreenLex 光影词库</h2>\n<p>ScreenLex 是黑粉科技 HyphenTech 出品的本地影视英语学习工具：把你本机已有的电影 / 剧集字幕，离线整理成按考试分级的高级英语词库，并配套逐句学习播放器与主动回忆复习。<strong>支持 macOS（Apple Silicon）与 Windows（x64 arm）。</strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>它不提供电影、不分发字幕资源；内置播放器只服务逐句学习，不替代完整观影体验。纯本地运行，不上传任何片源或字幕。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>下载</h3>\n<p>前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/screenlex-download/releases/latest\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"download\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/HackerChi-Hub/screenlex-download/releases/latest\"><strong>Releases</strong></a> 下载对应系统的安装包：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>安装包</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>macOS（Apple Silicon）</td>\n<td>ScreenLex_x.y.z_aarch64.dmg</td>\n<td>打开后将 ScreenLex 拖入「应用程序」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows（10 / 11，x64 arm）</td>\n<td>ScreenLex_x.y.z_x64-setup.exe</td>\n<td>双击安装，自动创建桌面与开始菜单快捷方式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>软件内「检查更新」会自动获取并安装新版本（macOS 与 Windows 各自更新到同一版本号）。</p>\n<h3>主要功能（macOS / Windows 一致）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>扫描本地电影 / 剧集，识别英文 SRT 与双语 ASS 字幕；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>离线提取高级词汇、短语与中文释义，按高考 / 四六级 / 考研 / 雅思 / 托福 / GRE 分级；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>可选 AI 精讲：例句、词源、记忆法、易混辨析、文化背景；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>主动回忆复习 + 自适应间隔；朗读、跟读、听写；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>逐句学习播放器：双语字幕、单句 / A-B 循环、倍速、时间点跳转；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本地 Whisper 补字幕、AI 校对、生成双语字幕、字幕体检；</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>首次使用「一键配置」自动下载并安装所需运行组件（FFmpeg、本地语音识别引擎、字幕模型），全部存放在程序目录内，可在向导中「全面清除」一键重置。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>平台差异（仅系统兼容部分不同）</h4>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>macOS</th>\n<th>Windows</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>本地语音识别引擎</td>\n<td>MLX Whisper（Apple Silicon 加速）</td>\n<td>whisper.cpp（**自动检测硬件：NVIDIA 显卡走 GPU/cuBLAS 加速，其余用 CPU**；A 卡 / 核显 / 无卡均可用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>其余全部功能</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅ 一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>截图</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/screenlex-watch-and-learn/image-01-66cd719d7b.png\" alt=\"工作台总览\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/screenlex-watch-and-learn/image-02-2df01110dd.png\" alt=\"分级词库与词卡\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/screenlex-watch-and-learn/image-03-4d8ed3a80f.png\" alt=\"侧边栏与批量处理\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<h3>安装提示</h3>\n<p>当前版本尚未进行 Apple 公证（notarization），macOS 会拦截。这<strong>不是安装包损坏</strong>，按下面处理即可。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>macOS</strong>：</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若提示「无法验证开发者」：右键点 <code>ScreenLex.app</code> →「打开」，或在「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性」中允许打开。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若提示「<strong>已损坏，无法打开</strong>」：这是 macOS 对未公证 app 加隔离属性所致，不是文件坏了。把 app 拖进「应用程序」后，打开「终端」执行以下命令去掉隔离属性，再双击即可：</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">sudo xattr -rd com.apple.quarantine /Applications/ScreenLex.app\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>（若 app 不在「应用程序」里，把上面的路径换成 app 实际所在位置。）\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Windows</strong>：若 SmartScreen 提示「Windows 已保护你的电脑」，点「更多信息」→「仍要运行」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>法律</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HackerChi-Hub/screenlex-download/main/USER_AGREEMENT.md\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HackerChi-Hub/screenlex-download/main/USER_AGREEMENT.md\">用户协议</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HackerChi-Hub/screenlex-download/main/DISCLAIMER.md\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HackerChi-Hub/screenlex-download/main/DISCLAIMER.md\">免责声明</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>说明</h3>\n<p>ScreenLex 为闭源发布软件。本公开仓库仅用于发布安装包与说明，不包含源代码。</p>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:localbrain-local-ai-box","rawId":"obsidian:localbrain-local-ai-box","slug":"localbrain-local-ai-box","legacyPaths":[],"title":"LocalBrain：Mac、Windows、Linux 的本地 AI 工作台","date":"2026-08-30","updated":"2026-10-31","summary":"Mac 2.2.2 已发布：统一环境维护按钮与结果、独立引擎升级和回滚、对话直接粘贴附件，Splash 1.5 实际问答与识图通过；Windows/Linux 2.2.2 独立发布，实测分平台说明。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-工具","name":"工具","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-开发","name":"开发","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/localbrain-local-ai-box/cover-7a52f6d721.jpg","cover":"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/localbrain-local-ai-box/cover-7a52f6d721.jpg","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"LocalBrain：Mac、Windows、Linux 的本地 AI 工作台","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"sourcePath":"posts/localbrain-local-ai-box.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:37a999681bdb81d6bd5def54e062aac4","rawId":"obsidian:37a999681bdb81d6bd5def54e062aac4","slug":"37a999681bdb81d6bd5def54e062aac4","legacyPaths":[],"title":"五维实测全记录！QoderWork综合能力评测：91分是什么水平？","date":"2026-06-10","updated":"2026-06-10","summary":"编程·推理·